nd-the-strains-2017/optimized/project_infant_strain_detection_chart.webp\" alt=\"We Found The Strains 2017\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-300\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/94a3b8?text=Image+Not+Found';\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" decoding=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> <div class=\"p-6\"> <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> We Found The Strains </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2\">2017</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\"> Research on microbial strain transmission from hospital surfaces to infants and environmental adaptation. </p> </div> </a><a href=\"/work/isme-2016/\" class=\"group block bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"height: 200px;\">  <picture> <source srcset=\"/images/work/isme-2016/optimized/isme_poster.avif\" type=\"image/avif\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/isme-2016/optimized/isme_poster.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/isme-2016/optimized/isme_poster.webp\">  <img src=\"/images/work/isme-2016/optimized/isme_poster.webp\" alt=\"ISME 2016 Research Poster\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-300\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/94a3b8?text=Image+Not+Found';\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" decoding=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> <div class=\"p-6\"> <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> ISME Poster </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2\">2016</p> <p class