x;\">  <picture> <source srcset=\"/images/work/preemies-in-a-nicu-2013/optimized/research-poster.avif\" type=\"image/avif\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/preemies-in-a-nicu-2013/optimized/research-poster.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/preemies-in-a-nicu-2013/optimized/research-poster.webp\">  <img src=\"/images/work/preemies-in-a-nicu-2013/optimized/research-poster.webp\" alt=\"Preemies in a NICU 2013\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-300\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/94a3b8?text=Image+Not+Found';\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" decoding=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> <div class=\"p-6\"> <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> Preemies in a NICU </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2\">2013</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\"> Final research poster presenting findings from our pilot study on microbial transmission between NICU environments and preterm infant microbiomes. </p> </div> </a><a href=\"/work/extraction-kit-comparison-2011/\" class=\"group block bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"height: 200px;\">  <picture> <source srcset=\"/images/work/extraction-kit-comparison-2011/optimized/poster.avif\" type=\"image/avif\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/extraction-kit-comparison-2011/optimized/poster.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/extraction-kit-comparison-2011/optimized/poster.webp\">  <img src=\"/images/work/extraction-kit-comparison-2011/optimized/poster.webp\" alt=\"Extraction Kit Comparison Poster\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-300\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/94a3b8?text=Image+Not+Found';\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" decoding=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> <div class=\"p-6\"> <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> Extraction Kit Comparison </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2\">2011</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\"> Graduate rotation project comparing DNA extraction kits for Crohn&#39;s disease cohort studies. Presented at BAGECO 2011; see poster for details. </p> </div> </a><a href=\"/work/pablo-picasso-and-henry-moore-meet-louis-pasteur-2009/\" class=\"group block bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"height: 200px;\">  <picture> <source srcset=\"/images/work/pablo-picasso-and-henry-moore-meet-louis-pasteur-2009/optimized/poster.avif\" type=\"image/avif\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/pablo-picasso-and-henry-moore-meet-louis-pasteur-2009/optimized/poster.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/pablo-picasso-and-henry-moore-meet-louis-pasteur-2009/optimized/poster.webp\">  <img src=\"/images/work/pablo-picasso-and-henry-moore-meet-louis-pasteur-2009/optimized/poster.webp\" alt=\"Pablo Picasso and Henry Moore Meet Louis Pasteur Project\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-300\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/94a3b8?text=Image+Not+Found';\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" decoding=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> <div class=\"p-6\"> <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> Pablo Picasso and Henry Moore Meet Louis Pasteur </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2\">2009</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\"> Interdisciplinary art-science project fusing microbiology with Renaissance art, featuring a bacterial recreation of The Creation of Adam. </p> </div> </a><a href=\"/work/microbes-tan-naked-2008/\" class=\"group block bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden\"> <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"height: 200px;\">  <picture> <source srcset=\"/images/work/microbes-tan-naked-2008/optimized/poster.avif\" type=\"image/avif\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/microbes-tan-naked-2008/optimized/poster.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">  <source srcset=\"/images/work/microbes-tan-naked-2008/optimized/poster.webp\">  <img src=\"/images/work/microbes-tan-naked-2008/optimized/poster.webp\" alt=\"MICROBES TAN NAKED 2008 Poster\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-300\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/94a3b8?text=Image+Not+Found';\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" decoding=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </div> <div class=\"p-6\"> <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> MICROBES TAN NAKED 2008 </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2\">2008</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\"> Research poster presented at the 2008 Wentz Spring Research Symposium: The Effects of Tanning Beds on the Normal Microbial Floral of the Human Skin by B. Brooks. </p> </div> </a> </div> </section> <section id=\"recent-writing\" class=\"mt-16\"> <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center\">\nRecent Writing\n</h2> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8\"> <article class=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow p-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"> <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\"> <a href=\"/blog/house-that-whitney-built/\" class=\"text-slate-900 dark:text-white hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> Dolly&#39;s Generous Legacy: Do Rich Women Give More Than Rich Men? </a> </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\">Aug 29, 2026</p> <p class=\"text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\"> Dolly Parton gave away about as much money as she kept. Her death sent me to the data: do the world&#39;s richest women give more than the richest men? </p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"> <a href=\"/tags/data-science/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Data Science </a><a href=\"/tags/philanthropy/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Philanthropy </a><a href=\"/tags/politics/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Politics </a> </div> </article><article class=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow p-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"> <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\"> <a href=\"/blog/single-cell-contamination-reckoning/\" class=\"text-slate-900 dark:text-white hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> Single-Cell Is About to Have Its Placenta Microbiome Moment </a> </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\">Aug 17, 2026</p> <p class=\"text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\"> Microbial ecology spent twenty years learning that in low-biomass samples, the thing you measure is partly your reagents. Single-cell has the same exposure, most of the same tooling gaps, and none of the same scar tissue \u2014 and the field is moving into exactly the regime where it starts to matter. </p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"> <a href=\"/tags/bioinformatics/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Bioinformatics </a><a href=\"/tags/single-cell/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Single-cell </a><a href=\"/tags/microbiome/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Microbiome </a> </div> </article><article class=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow p-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"> <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\"> <a href=\"/blog/journal-safari-pan-human-azimuth/\" class=\"text-slate-900 dark:text-white hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\"> Journal Safari: Seven Million Parameters and a MacBook Air </a> </h3> <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\">Aug 5, 2026</p> <p class=\"text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\"> Journal Safari #3. Pan-human Azimuth puts 27 million cells from 23 tissues on one annotation tree, then classifies them with a model 70\u00d7 smaller than the foundation model I read in July \u2014 and wins. The contribution is not the model. It is the labels. </p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"> <a href=\"/tags/journal-safari/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Journal Safari </a><a href=\"/tags/bioinformatics/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Bioinformatics </a><a href=\"/tags/single-cell/\" class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-sky-100 dark:hover:bg-sky-900 hover:text-sky-700 dark:hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors\"> Single-cell </a> </div> </article> </div> <p class=\"text-center mt-8\"> <a href=\"/blog/\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-700 dark:bg-sky-500 dark:hover:bg-sky-600 text-white font-medium transition-colors text-sm\">\nSee all writing &rarr;\n</a> </p> </section>   </main> <footer id=\"site-footer\" class=\"border-t border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 py-8 mt-12 transition-colors duration-200\"> <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"> <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"> <div class=\"flex gap-6 text-sm\"> <a href=\"/privacy/\" class=\"hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\">\nPrivacy Policy\n</a> <a href=\"/rss.xml\" class=\"hover:text-sky-600 dark:hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors\">\nRSS Feed\n</a> </div> <p class=\"text-sm\">&copy; 2026 B. Brooks. All rights reserved.</p> </div> </di